  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "A grim sense of isolation settles over those who wrap themselves in this soot-colored fabric. It offers a profound shield against the arcane, turning the very air into a wall of resistance. The shadows of Dol Guldur cling to the fibers, preserving the life of the one who hides within them."
    }
  },
  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Deep, soot-colored fabric hangs like a shadow, smelling of damp earth and old smoke. It clings to the wearer with a chilling chill, muffling the sound of footsteps and drawing the surrounding gloom inward."
    }
  },
